# profile: canvas   -- OFF by default. Canvas, for a session that needs it:
# handing back a graded exam, or a student checking a grade. Turn on with
# `classnet profile enable canvas`, off again with `classnet profile disable canvas`.
#
# Canvas has an Inbox and discussions, so this profile opens a way for students
# to message each other. Keep it off while students work on their own.
#
# Hosts found by tracing usfca.instructure.com from outside: the login page,
# its redirect to sign-in, and the download of a comment's PDF attachment.
# A course link signs in by way of sso.canvaslms.com, which /login does not.
# sso. is named exactly: the canvaslms.com apex would admit the community forums.
usfca.instructure.com
sso.canvaslms.com                     # Canvas's sign-in relay (delegated_auth_pass_through), on the way to CAS
canvadocs.instructure.com            # the inline document viewer (a PDF's preview)
du11hjcvx0uqb.cloudfront.net          # Canvas's own JS, CSS and fonts; nothing renders without it
instructure-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com  # the school's logo and theme files; the one bucket, not S3 at large
canvas-user-content.com               # a file download starts at a per-file aNNNN.clusterNN. host here
inscloudgate.net                      # ...and is handed to inst-fs-iad-prod. and cdn.inst-fs-iad-prod.

# Canvas sends a signed-out laptop to USF's CAS. The CAS page loads nothing from
# any other host, so the one name is enough; Duo answers if CAS asks for a
# second factor. garden.list already carries both, but only for devices that
# have not registered, and a student in class has.
usfcas.usfca.edu
duosecurity.com

# The targets of the CNAMEs above, each by its exact name. A Mac caches a CNAME
# and its target's A record separately; once the A record expires (60 s for
# CAS's load balancer) it asks for the target by name, and a target that is not
# allowed gets NXDOMAIN. Sign-in through CAS failed in class on 2026-10-22
# without these. If one of them changes, `dig @1.1.1.1 <alias>` names the new
# target.
cas-prod-169846813.us-west-2.elb.amazonaws.com                         # usfcas.usfca.edu
ae23d151f96c6e6fb.awsglobalaccelerator.com                             # sso.canvaslms.com
canvadocs-prod-iad-m3ymlwyb7k-155017668.us-east-1.elb.amazonaws.com    # canvadocs.instructure.com
s3-1-w.amazonaws.com                  # instructure-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com, then...
s3-w.us-east-1.amazonaws.com          # ...this
d3sskgxm7yyi0w.cloudfront.net         # aNNNN.clusterNN.canvas-user-content.com
dzyvg4d46ly1y.cloudfront.net          # inst-fs-iad-prod.inscloudgate.net
dppq4m4jupp04.cloudfront.net          # cdn.inst-fs-iad-prod.inscloudgate.net

# Deliberately NOT included: sentry.insops.net (error reporting) and
# www.instructure.com / help.instructure.com (marketing and help links).
